1
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,560
If the sun had been this nice yesterday,

2
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:51,490
my first mission wouldn't have been
a total failure.

3
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,760
It's all that damn Shen Feng's fault.

4
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,160
The mission was too hard.

5
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,970
Who said it was a total failure?

6
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:04,239
Seeing how hard you tried yesterday,

7
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,690
here is your reward.

8
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,840
So you get to decide whether
it's a success or a failure?

9
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,680
Of course.

10
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:16,210
I reserve the right
of final interpretation.

11
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,560
What is this pattern?

12
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,080
You'll find out once
you collect all the shards

13
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:20,480
and piece them together.

14
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:25,560
Come on.

15
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,520
Time to work.

16
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:30,890
Shake the bedsheet out before hanging it.

17
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:38,979
Didn't you eat?

18
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,720
You think everyone is like you?

19
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,450
Full of endless energy all day.

20
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,180
You're asking for it, huh?

21
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,240
Take this!

22
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,800
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

23
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,280
It was clearly you. I...

24
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,720
Forget it. It was an accident.

25
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,120
We're adults.

26
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,840
Little accidents happen.

27
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,300
Let's not take it to heart.

28
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,880
Way to go, Yun Qingqing.

29
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,640
You really messed up this time.

30
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:57,360
The gears of fate haven't turned at all,

31
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,420
but my life has completely derailed.

32
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:03,960
Forget it.

33
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,200
Let me do it.

34
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,320
What?

35
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:54,820
You did that on purpose again.

36
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:02,040
What's wrong? Why are you looking at me?

37
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,980
You look exactly like him.

38
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,920
Can you twist your waist?

39
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,560
Can you twist like this

40
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:11,760
for me?

41
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,160
What's in your head?

42
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,960
Nothing but dirty thoughts.

43
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,840
How did I not notice this before?

44
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,460
You really look exactly like him.

45
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:38,120
Yue Shanchuan recently got a new client.

46
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,800
Her surname is Shu, you know?

47
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:42,120
Pretty and rich.

48
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,520
Of course I know.

49
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,159
Yue Shanchuan is so lucky.

50
00:04:46,159 --> 00:04:48,690
He's gonna be the top seller
again this month.

51
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,920
I was on leave the day Ms. Shu came.

52
00:04:51,159 --> 00:04:53,200
Otherwise, he wouldn't have had a chance.

53
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,760
What's so great about him?

54
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:57,480
He has no skills, but he has the looks.

55
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,240
A pretty face is all he needs.

56
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,890
Weren't you here to get water?
Where is it?

57
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:08,960
I'll get it later.

58
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,130
Let's go back first.

59
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,720
Ms. Shu,

60
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,000
how was the class today?

61
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,160
If you're not satisfied,

62
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,240
you can ask for a replacement anytime.

63
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,800
Isn't this Yue Shanchuan's cup?

64
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,600
He actually dared to ask you
to get water for him?

65
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,730
That's outrageous.

66
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,330
I didn't pour it for him.

67
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,800
I poured it for you guys.

68
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:35,000
Because your mouths are so foul.

69
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,520
How could you...

70
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:37,800
I swear I'll make you...

71
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,840
Shu Rong,

72
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,050
don't be impulsive.

73
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:44,360
If I catch you gossiping again,

74
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,680
you'll be sorry.

75
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,360
Why did you stop me?

76
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,930
Don't do that next time.

77
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,440
I'm not worth it.

78
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,920
They talk about you like that,
and you're not even mad?

79
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,920
Why did you go mute around them?

80
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:04,200
People like them just love to gossip.

81
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:06,440
Arguing with them is a waste of breath.

82
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,440
I'm used to it.

83
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:12,120
Alright. In that case,

84
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,160
don't just bear the reputation
for nothing.

85
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,960
How about

86
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:17,360
I reluctantly let you rely on me?

87
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:18,640
Stop joking.

88
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:19,720
I'm not joking.

89
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:23,300
Come to me anytime
when you've made up your mind.

90
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:39,360
The compatibility is up to 99.99%.

91
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:43,080
Qingqing, pass me the salt.

92
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,120
Here.

93
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:54,920
This familiar, thrilling feeling...

94
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,680
Are they really not the same person?

95
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:28,640
Shen Feng,

96
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:31,100
what are we having for dinner?

97
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,320
You'll find out soon.

98
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,210
There's a mosquito.

99
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,640
There's another one over there.

100
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:39,760
Stop messing around.

101
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:41,890
I'm not. There really are mosquitoes.

102
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,440
Go sit down. Dinner is almost ready.

103
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,040
Okay.

104
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,560
Mr. Feng,

105
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:52,680
according to your habit,

106
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,810
are you getting ready for a shower now?

107
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,360
I'm in a really bad mood today

108
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,880
and desperately need some comfort.

109
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,800
I wonder if the merciful Mr. Feng

110
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:03,000
could reward me with
some new content before your shower?

111
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:05,040
I was planning to update today anyway.

112
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,440
I'll let you see it first.

113
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,240
Beauty is distracting.

114
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,170
I almost forgot the real business.

115
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,760
This is super popular right now.

116
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:31,320
Please try it too, sir. I'm begging you.

117
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:46,720
This content doesn't move.
Do you have any that moves?

118
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:54,560
This was just shot.
No special effects added yet.

119
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,960
Help me check the effect.

120
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,340
Even if that stamp was washed with water,

121
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,980
it couldn't leave no trace at all, right?

122
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,860
Could it really not be him?

123
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,920
It's not the time yet.

124
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,000
Qing,

125
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,320
I failed to get the funding.

126
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,240
Tang,

127
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,260
you don't have much time left.

128
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:45,300
There's only one guest
at the guesthouse right now.

129
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,040
Even though she booked for a month,

130
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,000
one person

131
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:50,000
can't cover such a huge deficit.

132
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,160
I know. I know.

133
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,920
I'll figure something out.

134
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,680
If that doesn't work,

135
00:09:57,040 --> 00:10:00,080
I'll just have to go back
and share a grave with you.

136
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:02,280
I'm so sleepy. I'm going to bed.

137
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,760
Good night, Qing.

138
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,120
I bet this guy

139
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:10,960
is secretly crying under the covers again.

140
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:11,440
Congratulations

141
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:11,640
and

142
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:12,720
welcome.

143
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,320
Congratulations.

144
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,050
Congratulations and welcome.

145
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:15,600
Congratulations

146
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,240
and welcome.

147
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,300
Congratulations.

148
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:17,940
Huge...

149
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:45,360
What kind of mosquito bit you?

150
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,100
That's a huge mark.

151
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,720
What are you doing?
Keep your hands to yourself.

152
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,400
What's going on between you and Shu Rong?

153
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,320
Tell me. You like her?

154
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:54,380
Are you dating?

155
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,160
No. Don't talk nonsense.

156
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:59,120
She just signed up for my flight course,
that's all.

157
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,240
Just a trainee.

158
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,200
Come on.

159
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,840
I know you too well.

160
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,240
Dating is great.

161
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,680
What's there to hide?

162
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,960
We're not in a relationship.

163
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,040
To her,

164
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:12,320
I'm just a conquest and a novelty.

165
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,560
Besides, you know my situation.

166
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:17,320
I'm in no position
to start a new relationship.

167
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,840
Seriously, man?

168
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:21,220
You're just with her without a title?

169
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,660
What's that supposed to mean?

170
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,900
You don't know her.

171
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,840
She's very domineering.

172
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,760
I simply can't say no.

173
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,360
You can fool me,

174
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,840
but don't fool yourself.

175
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,440
Is it really that you can't say no?

176
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,440
I think

177
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,920
you just don't want to.

178
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:47,360
Don't worry.

179
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:49,400
It definitely won't happen again.

180
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:51,800
I'll definitely draw
a clear line with her.

181
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,800
Don't just talk about me.

182
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:58,040
What about you?
How are things with Manager Yun?

183
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,360
Did she remember you?

184
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,920
She did remember.

185
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:05,200
But it seems she doesn't want
to acknowledge it.

186
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,880
I told you.

187
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:09,440
She never took
that in-game romance seriously.

188
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:11,960
It was all just your wishful thinking.

189
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,080
That's fine.

190
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:14,640
I'm in no rush.

191
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:16,800
Anyway, what she needs most right now

192
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:17,840
isn't love.

193
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,480
Then what is it?

194
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:22,280
What she needs most right now

195
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:24,640
is to find her old self.
